hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1388","Hum se Yahya ne, Malik se, Ibn Shihab se, Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Khaibar ke yahood se us din jab Khaibar fatah hua farmaya ke main tumhein is mein rakhta hun jab tak Allah Azza wa Jal tumhein rakhe, is shart par ke phal hamare aur tumhare darmiyan hai. Unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Abdullah bin Rawaha ko bhejte they to wo un ke aur yahood ke darmiyan andaza lagate phir kehte ke agar chaho to tumhare liye hai aur agar chaho to mere liye hai. To wo use le lete they."
"1389","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Dinar se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat pahunchi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo shakhs khana khareede wo use na beche yahan tak ke use qabze mein le le."
